<!-- Template Description -->
This template converts various date formats to YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss format in GMT.
Parameters:
* {{{1}}} for date (e.g., June 20th, 2024)
* {{{2}}} for time in JST (optional, e.g., 20:30)
Usage: 
<pre>{{Time_ago/FormatDate|June 20th, 2024}} or {{Time_ago/FormatDate|Jun 20, 2024|20:30}}</pre>
Return: {{Time_ago/FormatDate|June 20th, 2024}} or {{Time_ago/FormatDate|Jun 20, 2024|20:30}}